    "number": 188,
    "title": "Prepare complete BUNNY atlas for public guide publication",
    "body": "Refs #186\n\n## Scope\n- Export the complete BUNNY atlas as a deterministic `/atlas/` Pages tree with an exact SHA-256 manifest, 26 component pages, state/action view, API and empty-schema database reference, and required offline assets.\n- Add navigation between the atlas and public work guide, including the nine architecture viewers at `/architecture/`.\n- Refresh the dated guide snapshot and generated HTML; update the public edition procedure and export instructions.\n\n## Candidate and evidence\n- Base: `eeaa76439ba449adcd447750c0996817d12d6e7c`; head: `5ac98f5765ef0a3805ed1a37d7c6defabdb9a6cd`; merge-base: base. Worktree clean.\n- Clean `git archive HEAD` export: 384 atlas files plus manifest, with the validation receipt excluded. Manifest SHA-256: `44e0596bc81e1b63c313a8369068f440570444a6654c56a453070f81835897f1`.\n- Hub guide HTML: 807726 bytes, SHA-256 `bbaa543f67d65efcdfb7dee4b774e0f9929368b2a911bcaa321933e23a232a71`; archive rebuild matches. Exported public guide SHA-256: `56cd8ea515f7c8b2c1824b4620b39c76adb738d48d785ac43091252f97327fbb`.\n- Atlas source checks: 28 documents, 37 API operations, 28 empty-schema tables, 53 reference HTML pages, 2330 local references; source browser checks passed at desktop/mobile widths with blocked external requests.\n- Guide maintenance: 10 tests passed; browser checks passed at 1440/1000/900/768/390/320 widths, with zero page errors.\n- Staged public-layout browser check: guide-to-atlas, atlas-to-guide, component/reference/viewer navigation at 1440 and 390 widths, zero page errors. State/action viewer and database reference had zero external requests or page errors. The local guide link resolves to the local atlas.\n- Public file audit: 397 intended site files including guide, nine viewers, atlas, `.nojekyll` and README; manifest bytes checked; no personal filesystem paths, credentials, private runtime data or unrelated source files found. Database reference derives from empty schema fixtures.\n\n## Delivery gates\n- Human approval of this fixed atlas UI candidate is pending under `docs/sdlc.md`.\n- Independent Standards and Specification reviews and current-head CI must pass before guarded merge; merged-main CI must pass before issue closure.\n- Public copying and live Pages verification remain in `jimmie-potts/agent-device-guide#9` after the exact merged Hub revision is known.\n- No product OpenSpec delta: this change is documentation publication tooling and navigation; no API, controller, installation or physical-device behavior changes.\n",
    "state": "open",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/jimmie-potts/agent-device-hub/pull/188",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-23T08:31:25Z",
    "draft": false,
    "head": {
